https://github.com/t-head/pytorch-for-sail (branch v2.14.1, commit
8b41b061e474), a derivative of PyTorch distributed under the
BSD-3-Clause License.  Patch contexts may be refreshed for later
v2.14.1 revisions; record the actual upstream commit when assembling
sources.  Copyright and license notices from upstream files are retained
verbatim.  The repository copyright applies to newly added compat code
and modifications; it does not replace upstream copyright notices.

